  "description": "The story of 2 high school students and their growth as they have a hard time around immature adults. \n\nYoon Jungwon, the model student and class president, seems to be hiding a secret, and Kwak Gilsung, a rising Taekwondo player stuck in his rebellious phase. Why are these two drawn toward each other? \n\nThe tearful growth of two people exploring their youth! \n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
